<view class="page">
  <view class="intro">
    <text class="intro-title">绑定孩子</text>
    <text class="intro-sub">填写报名时的学员姓名与手机号，即可同步查看课时、课堂表现和成绩</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card form">
    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">学员姓名</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        value="{{name}}"
        placeholder="请输入孩子的姓名"
        placeholder-class="ph"
        maxlength="20"
        bindinput="onNameInput"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">报名手机号</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        type="number"
        value="{{phone}}"
        placeholder="请输入报名时预留的手机号"
        placeholder-class="ph"
        maxlength="11"
        bindinput="onPhoneInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>

    <button class="btn submit" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">确认绑定</button>
  </view>

  <view class="tips">
    <view class="tip">手机号需与校区报名档案中的家长手机号一致</view>
    <view class="tip">绑定后，若校区更新学员信息，小程序会自动同步</view>
    <view class="tip">一个微信可绑定多个孩子，在页面顶部随时切换</view>
  </view>
</view>
